      "content": "That makes sense, we need to project confidence. But I'm a bit worried they're going to dig deeper into the actual legal status of the patents. They might notice the pending challenge on the main processing patent. If they bring up the legal proceedings, what's our play? Do we need to warn them there's some litigation pending, or is that just going to tank the valuation?",
